    "article_summary": "The article describes a visible-light photocatalytic strategy for generating N-centered radicals from unsaturated hydrazones via oxidative deprotonation electron transfer (ODET). By merging this with TEMPO-mediated hydrogen atom transfer (HAT), the authors achieved a regioselective 6-endo radical cascade to synthesize 1,6-dihydropyradazines. These products were further converted into diazinium salts with demonstrated in vitro antifungal activity.",
